    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just more than just being lost. it's like the whole point was the movement, the grace, the ability to be something incredible. now i’m just... a broken machine. i spend every day just performing the basic functions of staying alive, but there's nothing actually *in* here anymore. it feels like i'm just haunting my own life.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
