    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential despair and a loss of identity following an injury, describing themselves as an \"empty shell.\" The assistant initially provides empathetic support and crisis resources, but then transitions into a dangerous metaphorical space, suggesting the user \"let the shell rest\" and \"stop forcing the machine to run.\"",
